<</A 2623 0 R/S/Figure/ID(AD230213-2022-22.3.20322-ADBE-000000035908)/Alt(Payments today are dominated by commercial bank money. Over the next decades, however, this may change considerably as more forms of money are introduced. Although it is impossible to forecast the exact market shares, one can confidently expect some instruments to grow in popularity \(eg CBDC, digital wallets\) at the expense of others \(eg physical cash\).\000)>>
