1344 0 obj
<</P 1365 0 R/A 1375 0 R/S/Figure/T()/Pg 37 0 R/Alt(Payments today are dominated by commercial bank money. Over the next decades, however, this may change considerably as more forms of money are introduced. Although it is impossible to forecast the exact market shares, one can confidently expect some instruments to grow in popularity \(eg CBDC, digital wallets\) at the expense of others \(eg physical cash\).\000)/K 139>>
endobj

1345 0 obj
<</P 570 0 R/S/Span/T()/Pg 65 0 R/K[26 25]>>
endobj

1346 0 obj
<</A 1540 0 R/S/Figure/T()/Pg 65 0 R/Alt(According to a survey conducted by the ECB, people would abandon electronic cash if it were not safe, if they were to lose all their money, or if cash were to cost something. However this self-selecting sample put \217privacy\220 well above \217security\220 and \217no cost\220, demonstrating that it is more accurate to watch what people do, rather than listen to what they say they would do.\000)/K 28>>
endobj

